in plot shows how fare distributions vary across different payment methods.\n","\n","## Conclusion\n","\n","The taxi dataset was cleaned and analyzed using Pandas, Matplotlib, and Seaborn. Missing categorical values were handled using the mode, and multiple visualizations were created to understand fare, distance, payment methods, tips, and customer trip patterns. These visualizations provide useful insights into taxi trip behavior and the relationships between different numerical variables."],"metadata":{"id":"ltePCSINtlyg"}}]}